    "transport": "Three rental cars are booked, one per family. Lion and Little Fish families each have a car, originally recorded as Hyundai Creta or similar compact SUV; Maple family uses a minivan. Take the Hertz shuttle from PTY. Confirm models, seats and luggage space against each reservation. San Blas on December 24 includes pickup at Residence Inn and Megapolis; separate road vehicles but the same boat for all fourteen.",
