    "places": "Panama Canal, December 23; exact visitor site undecided.\nSan Blas Islands / Isla Perro, December 24; fourteen travelers booked.\nGamboa / Gatún Lake / Monkey Island, December 25 boat trip confirmed; exact route to verify.\nEl Valle de Antón.\nGran Evenia Bijao – All Inclusive.\nPanama City / Radisson Hotel Panama Canal.",
    "itinerary": "Day 1 · Tue, Dec 22|Little Fish and Maple families arrive 17:12; Lion family 18:00. Collect cars, check in and rest.\nDay 2 · Wed, Dec 23|Panama Canal day; exact visitor site, tickets and times remain undecided.\nDay 3 · Thu, Dec 24|San Blas excursion with pickup at Residence Inn and Megapolis. The listing gives a 05:00 start; exact hotel pickup times need confirmation.\nDay 4 · Fri, Dec 25|Check out, take the Gamboa boat trip at 11:00, then lunch and drive to El Valle.\nDay 5 · Sat, Dec 26|El Valle sightseeing, with exact activities undecided. Leave rest time for children and older adults.\nDay 6 · Sun, Dec 27|Check out and drive to Gran Evenia Bijao – All Inclusive.\nDay 7 · Mon, Dec 28|A full resort day for the beach, pool and rest.\nDay 8 · Tue, Dec 29|Return to Panama City. Maple and Little Fish families stay at Radisson Hotel Panama Canal.\nDay 9 · Wed, Dec 30|Lion family flies to Mexico City; Little Fish and Maple families fly to Houston.",
    "aurora": "Lodging: Panama City 3 nights → El Valle 2 → Bijao 2 → Panama City 1.\nThree families, fourteen travelers and three rental cars. San Blas uses separate road vehicles and one shared boat.\nBooked activities: December 24 San Blas; December 25 Gamboa boat tour at 11:00.\nLast night: Maple and Little Fish families stay at Radisson Hotel Panama Canal; Lion family has separate arrangements.\nPace: Sleep early before San Blas. Transfer to El Valle after the Christmas Day boat tour. Keep December 28 relaxed at the resort.",
    "summary": "Three families and fourteen travelers spend nine days / eight nights in Panama over Christmas, with a rental car per family. Start with three Panama City nights for the canal and San Blas. After the December 25 11:00 Gamboa cruise, stay two nights in El Valle de Antón, then two at Gran Evenia Bijao. Return to Panama City December 29 and leave on two separate flights December 30.",
